- six emergency and trauma hospitals, each 22,500 square meters, the size of the HT hospital ready to operate in Campina Grande, but only to start functioning when the people forget it was completed during the previous government;

- two emergency and trauma hospitals with the same dimensions as the Campina Grande HT, fully equipped, or – get this! – 397 Family Health Units (USFs) following the model of those being built by the City Hall of João Pessoa;

- fifteen full-time schools with capacity for 400 students each, similar to the one recently inaugurated by the Capital City Hall in Bessa, with two floors, ten classrooms, computer and science labs, arts room, video room, library, bathrooms, administration, management, teachers' room, and a secretariat, plus a gym.

complete sports facilities, from clothing to bathrooms, from the grandstands to the coverage;
